		<content type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Last August &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; joined &lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange Project&lt;/strong&gt; to find out a new dancer for her &lt;a href=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-world-tour-2012.html&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot; title=&quot;Madonna's World Tour 2012&quot;&gt;next tour&lt;/a&gt;, which will start on 2012.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The first event will take place on &lt;strong&gt;September 8 2011&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;New York City&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt;'s long-time choreographers &lt;strong&gt;Rich &amp;amp; Tone Talauega&lt;/strong&gt; will judge the auditioners. The selected dancer will attend the final &lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff Nighlife Exchange Project&lt;/strong&gt; in front of &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; which will take place in on &lt;strong&gt;November 12 2011&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;New York&lt;/strong&gt; as well. The final winner will dance on &lt;a href=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-world-tour-2012.html&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot; title=&quot;Madonna's World Tour 2012&quot;&gt;tour&lt;/a&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;Madonna&lt;/strong&gt; in 2012.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are the details for September 8 audition, as you can also see on the flyer below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Broadway Dance Center 322 West 45th Street New York City&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Doors open at 7am&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditions from 8am to 1pm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditions only for resident in New York and Connecticut&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditioners must be 21 or over&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring proper identification showing current address&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditioners must come dressed to dance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auditioners must NOT wear clothing with visible logos/brands, since all auditions may be filmed for use in future promotional content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://drownedmadonna.com/img/2011/madonna-tour-dancer-auditions-nyc.jpg&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;Madonna tour dancers auditions NYC&quot; width=&quot;790&quot; height=&quot;602&quot; style=&quot;border: 0pt none;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New York&lt;/strong&gt; event is the only one confirmed at this point, but there could be others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don't forget you can also apply online. Submit a 60-second dance video until October 10. For details on the dance submission process and terms and conditions, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.smirnoff.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Smirnoff&quot;&gt;www.smirnoff.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ten Finalists will be contacted via email by 17 October 2011 and must be eligible and able to travel to &lt;strong&gt;New York&lt;/strong&gt; within the period of 7 to 12 November 2011 to take part to the final &lt;strong&gt;Smirnoff Nightlife Exchage Project&lt;/strong&gt; event.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
